# ⌘K (Switcher.tsx ChatSwitcher, sfdesk/switcher.mbt): MBUI_WIN=1280x800 over the made-up chat. Opened with nothing
# typed (the latest chats, what can be done), 发布 typed (the chats it finds), ↓; cleared, 设置 typed (the commands and
# pages named so), ↓ twice; Esc.
timeout 20000
until 按空格输入
wait 600
key cmd+k
wait 1200
type 发布
wait 1200
key down
wait 800
clear
wait 300
type 设置
wait 1200
key down
wait 500
key down
wait 800
key esc
wait 800
exit
